<title>USA: Celestial stake raised by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Celestial stake raised by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Monday it raised its stake in Celestial Seasonings Inc to 8.83 percent or 357,700 common shares of the company's 4,050,916 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net of 45,200 shares between Dec. 16 and Jan. 24 at prices ranging from $19.5313 to $22.6250 per share.</p>
